          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne meme, bana betu, hanakalua kunudi, tshiakalua ne bulengele bua mei anyi bua meshi, hanakadi nuambila bualu busokoka bua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nakadisungula munda bua meme tshimunyi bunga bualu munkatshi muenu, anu Yesu Kilisto, ne yeye mushihibue ku mutshi mutshiamakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakadi nʼenu mu butekete ne mu ditshina ne mu kuzakala kua bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dianyi ne kuamba kuanyi kabiakadi mu mei a meshi a kuitabushisha nʼau bantu, kadi biakadi mu dimuenesha dia Nyuma Muimpe ne dia bukole; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua ditabusha dienu kadikadi mu meshi a bantu, kadi dikale mu bukole bua Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudi tuamba mei a meshi munkatshi mua bantu bakamana kukola mu bualu bua Nzambi, kadi kemeshi a tshikondo etshi anyi a bakokeshi ba tshikondo etshi balualua ba hatuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi tudi tuamba meshi a Nzambi mu bualu busokoka, meshi mene akadi masokoka, akadianjila Nzambi kusungula ku mpala kua bikondo bionso bua butumbi buetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuakadi umue wa bakokeshi ba tshikondo etshi wakuamanya; bua bu bobo bâmanye, kabakadi kushiha Mukelenge wa butumbi ku mutshi mutshiamakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bu muakafundabo ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
